### Java health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/java/health

### Kotlin health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kotlin/health

### Java chat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/java/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain what a Java record is.",
  "systemPrompt": "You are a concise senior Java engineer."
}

### Kotlin chat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kotlin/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain what a Kotlin data class is."
}

### Validation error (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/java/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "" }
